{"schema_version":1,"batch_id":"screening-0096","screening_model":"gpt-5.6-luna","reasoning":"medium","prompt_version":"gauss-screening-v1","item_count":6,"subject":"math","topic_key":"statistics","total_weight":108,"expected_output":"screening-0096.output.jsonl","items":[{"question_id":"nardebam_math_1405_2008","source_sha256":"9f84284790cf1315a5f8f185c461d9f8a5fb27172cccdb1927bce2d3096ebe43","subject":"math","section_id":"math_discrete_data","source_topic_key":"statistics","source_difficulty":"hard","stem":[{"type":"text","text":"هرگاه میانگین $۲x_1-۱,۲x_2-۲,۲x_3-۳,\\dots,۲x_{10}-۱۰$ برابر $۱/۵$ باشد، میانگین اعداد $۳x_1+۱,۳x_2+۲,\\dots,۳x_{10}+۱۰$ چه عددی است؟"},{"type":"image","asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_2008/stem_1.webp","alt":"صورت سوال ۲۰۰۸","aspect_ratio":16.9176}],"options":[[{"type":"text","text":"$۶$"},{"type":"image","asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_2008/option_1_2.webp","alt":"گزینه ۱","aspect_ratio":0.8706}],[{"type":"text","text":"$۶/۵$"},{"type":"image","asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_2008/option_2_3.webp","alt":"گزینه ۲","aspect_ratio":1.0353}],[{"type":"text","text":"$۷$"},{"type":"image","asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_2008/option_3_4.webp","alt":"گزینه ۳","aspect_ratio":0.8471}],[{"type":"text","text":"$۷/۵$"},{"type":"image","asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_2008/option_4_5.webp","alt":"گزینه ۴","aspect_ratio":1.1882}]],"solution":[{"type":"text","text":"میانگین داده‌های اولیه را می‌نویسیم:\n$\\frac{(2x_1 - 1) + (2x_2 + 2) + (2x_3 - 3) + \\cdots (2x_{10} + 10)}{10} = 1/5$\n$\\Rightarrow 2(x_1 + x_2 + \\cdots + x_{10}) + \\frac{(-1 + 2 - 3 + 4 - \\cdots + 10)}{5} = 15$\n$\\Rightarrow x_1 + x_2 + \\cdots + x_{10} = 5$\nحال میانگین جدید را به دست می‌آوریم:\n$\\overline{x} = \\frac{(3x_1 + 1) + (3x_2 + 2) + \\cdots + (3x_{10} + 10)}{10}$\n$= \\frac{3(x_1 + x_2 + \\cdots + x_{10}) + (1 + 2 + \\cdots + 10)}{10} = \\frac{(3 \\times 5) + (55)}{10} = 7$"},{"type":"image","asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_2008/solution_6.webp","alt":"Solution for 2008","aspect_ratio":1.3762}],"smart_shortcut":null,"media_assets":["question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_2008/option_1_2.webp","question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_2008/option_2_3.webp","question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_2008/option_3_4.webp","question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_2008/option_4_5.webp","question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_2008/solution_6.webp","question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_2008/stem_1.webp"],"media_evidence":[{"asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_2008/option_1_2.webp","sha256":"a10e858df65a6dd0ff48257252b78e20769ac656b3c66ed405df7833ffc41aab","bytes":896},{"asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_2008/option_2_3.webp","sha256":"67fb66c3495995c5be7daba9e98e0da39c7c854fe3825a80f8ac84d5465c6fe5","bytes":1220},{"asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_2008/option_3_4.webp","sha256":"0870fb73a75af3e3a19ba29e3b3a70f660d6208bb56a58b043dff4a503b68442","bytes":1314},{"asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_2008/option_4_5.webp","sha256":"2a8f696b991297ff8e2f9f1c8f63fc0e7239732950595dda47c2ed2333608616","bytes":1634},{"asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_2008/solution_6.webp","sha256":"2534f56ed728f8116ffe584316f828c7e677b67d931104257ce2d86f0645cd83","bytes":28500},{"asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_2008/stem_1.webp","sha256":"3acc62cfa2ff16c1002a81a8b3f3a7ca7aac42a311b50b3ddef75e687330a32d","bytes":15740}],"provenance":{"edition":"nardebam_1405","question_number":2008,"question_pdf":"18.pdf","question_page":5,"solution_page":187,"solution_origin":"source"},"source_answer_hidden":true},{"question_id":"nardebam_math_1405_2009","source_sha256":"6a7c861281a6686f8ad445a1dc3a3412032f53dd28cbb59d16da0aeb9d7146d1","subject":"math","section_id":"math_discrete_data","source_topic_key":"statistics","source_difficulty":"hard","stem":[{"type":"text","text":"گروه ۱۰نفری از مردان با میانگین سن $\\overline{x}$ و گروه ۳۰نفری از زنان با میانگین سن $\\overline{x}-۴$ در یک جمع حاضرند. اگر میانگین کل ۲۱ باشد، میانگین سن زنان چه عددی است؟"},{"type":"image","asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_2009/stem_1.webp","alt":"صورت سوال ۲۰۰۹","aspect_ratio":10.5662}],"options":[[{"type":"text","text":"$۱۹$"},{"type":"image","asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_2009/option_1_2.webp","alt":"گزینه ۱","aspect_ratio":1.0366}],[{"type":"text","text":"$۲۰$"},{"type":"image","asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_2009/option_2_3.webp","alt":"گزینه ۲","aspect_ratio":1.0488}],[{"type":"text","text":"$۲۳$"},{"type":"image","asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_2009/option_3_4.webp","alt":"گزینه ۳","aspect_ratio":1.0244}],[{"type":"text","text":"$۲۴$"},{"type":"image","asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_2009/option_4_5.webp","alt":"گزینه ۴","aspect_ratio":1.0732}]],"solution":[{"type":"text","text":"اگر $n$ داده با میانگین $\\overline{x}$ و $m$ داده با میانگین $\\overline{y}$ با هم ادغام شوند، میانگین کل داده‌ها برابر است با:\n$\\frac{n\\overline{x} + m\\overline{y}}{m + n}$\nمیانگین کل $= \\frac{10 \\times \\overline{x} + 30(\\overline{x} - 4)}{40} = 21 \\Rightarrow 40\\overline{x} - 120 = 840$\n$\\Rightarrow \\overline{x} = \\frac{960}{40} = 24 \\xrightarrow{\\text{میانگین سن زنان}} \\overline{x} - 4 = 20$"},{"type":"image","asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_2009/solution_part_1_6.webp","alt":"Solution for 2009 part 1","aspect_ratio":2.9574},{"type":"image","asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_2009/solution_part_2_7.webp","alt":"Solution for 2009 part 2","aspect_ratio":3.5781}],"smart_shortcut":null,"media_assets":["question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_2009/option_1_2.webp","question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_2009/option_2_3.webp","question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_2009/option_3_4.webp","question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_2009/option_4_5.webp","question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_2009/solution_part_1_6.webp","question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_2009/solution_part_2_7.webp","question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_2009/stem_1.webp"],"media_evidence":[{"asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_2009/option_1_2.webp","sha256":"24178bdcecd369d5bd14ef9b4efa16608bf067875c1896d94ab8c3cff787652b","bytes":76},{"asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_2009/option_2_3.webp","sha256":"e3140f7ca94a2509a55f6efbb5afddcd4432239ab03ec3828043ed863d02261a","bytes":76},{"asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_2009/option_3_4.webp","sha256":"59fe3e6d8c3dbde769b252d873afb7389c8adc728940bb9e54f7116ec9b0f41e","bytes":76},{"asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_2009/option_4_5.webp","sha256":"6f994238c4cebcfa9e6c16965cced2a11b458b0b58c7256280a922b13909ee85","bytes":76},{"asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_2009/solution_part_1_6.webp","sha256":"dc16cb35ae00f45c8daa960b18cb64c3808a1d633cfa80097d95bc79efc86815","bytes":9728},{"asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_2009/solution_part_2_7.webp","sha256":"9b0a88b99f53a5b8f08152296dfcbd01332de0c56393fa1808fde532d9a8e45b","bytes":11316},{"asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_2009/stem_1.webp","sha256":"cf47b5af8b16b184cc68f7d23eb954f0052d8bd80cc85497304b83beb616acc9","bytes":834}],"provenance":{"edition":"nardebam_1405","question_number":2009,"question_pdf":"18.pdf","question_page":5,"solution_page":187,"solution_origin":"source"},"source_answer_hidden":true},{"question_id":"nardebam_math_1405_2010","source_sha256":"c0cf204f9998f026da8f1d58dd15ba8237488df82af55ad31ba8e87c874c8412","subject":"math","section_id":"math_discrete_data","source_topic_key":"statistics","source_difficulty":"hard","stem":[{"type":"text","text":"در داده‌های $۱,۲,۳,\\dots,۱۰$ اختلاف چارک اول و سوم چه عددی است؟"},{"type":"image","asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_2010/stem_1.webp","alt":"صورت سوال ۲۰۱۰","aspect_ratio":8.6}],"options":[[{"type":"text","text":"$۳$"},{"type":"image","asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_2010/option_1_2.webp","alt":"گزینه ۱","aspect_ratio":1.0816}],[{"type":"text","text":"$۳/۵$"},{"type":"image","asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_2010/option_2_3.webp","alt":"گزینه ۲","aspect_ratio":1.2449}],[{"type":"text","text":"$۴/۵$"},{"type":"image","asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_2010/option_3_4.webp","alt":"گزینه ۳","aspect_ratio":1.2041}],[{"type":"text","text":"$۵$"},{"type":"image","asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_2010/option_4_5.webp","alt":"گزینه ۴","aspect_ratio":1.0612}]],"solution":[{"type":"text","text":"$\\text{میانگین کل} = \\frac{10\\times\\overline{x} + 30(\\overline{x}-4)}{40} = 21 \\Rightarrow 40\\overline{x}-120=840$\n$\\Rightarrow \\overline{x} = \\frac{960}{40} = 24 \\xrightarrow{\\text{میانگین سن زنان}} \\overline{x}-4=20$\nچارک‌ها را تعیین می‌کنیم:\n$1, 2, \\underset{\\downarrow}{Q_1 \\rightarrow \\mathbf{3}}, 4, 5 \\, , \\, 6, 7, \\underset{\\downarrow}{Q_3 \\rightarrow \\mathbf{8}}, 9, 10$\n$Q_3-Q_1=8-3=5$"}],"smart_shortcut":null,"media_assets":["question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_2010/option_1_2.webp","question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_2010/option_2_3.webp","question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_2010/option_3_4.webp","question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_2010/option_4_5.webp","question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_2010/stem_1.webp"],"media_evidence":[{"asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_2010/option_1_2.webp","sha256":"08c0d8e95bfe87ea9d08ae37b71ab603837f71073da822fbc75b89cc98e555bb","bytes":332},{"asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_2010/option_2_3.webp","sha256":"40ce83cccc7aaab7ca45b9004a8aa5de9731beed2a92b18ce5c0e3738cd9e8ba","bytes":362},{"asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_2010/option_3_4.webp","sha256":"48a910adeca165316824e4d5e45c6bdb4bcf105b5a310be316b0ed4d9d3b9fff","bytes":418},{"asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_2010/option_4_5.webp","sha256":"ae13acee753ba02c1a80721ce35906c87a7f81306a1db4308d